== Description ==

'''Waste plastic''' is an item in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 10 downstream recipes at 3 different workbenches, including [[M1891 01]], [[R870 01]], [[M1A]], [[Solar Generator]], [[Firearm Kit]], [[M1911]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

